[Otherwise write me a mail ! ...smile...]


Introduction
~~~~~~~~~~~~
tAI N0dEINf0 displays a little info about the ports of your bbs !
This info includes : PortNumber, Modem, Handle [or (OFFLINE), (IDLE)], 
                     CPS, Info about the Node [Speed, Use...]

It should be used in the logon-sequence.

Installation
~~~~~~~~~~~~
[Delete the old version (V1.0) of tAi-nodeinfo !] 
Copy the file "tAI-N0dEINf0.rexx" to your pfiles.
Add it in your sys.welcome or somewhere else in your logon-sequence
as an arexx-file !
like : #0pfiles:tAI-N0dEINf0.rexx}
       ^
       |
       `Ctrl-Q

Load your prefered texteditor and CONFIGURE "tAI-N0dEINf0.rexx" !!!

THAT'S ALL ! [Easy isn't it ??? 8-)]


